{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-commutative-crossing-energy-table1-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:commutative-crossing-energy-table1-data","kind":"table","title":"Table 1 from rem:commutative-crossing-energy","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-commutative-crossing-energy"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"commutative-crossing-energy-table1-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:commutative-crossing-energy-table1-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Table 1 from rem:commutative-crossing-energy</em></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Object</th>\n<th>Non-commutative <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(q \\neq 1)</code></th>\n<th>Commutative <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(q = 1)</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Hopf algebra</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{O}_q(\\mathrm{SU}(2))</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{O}(\\mathrm{SU}(2))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Braiding</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c \\circ c \\neq \\mathrm{id}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c \\circ c = \\mathrm{id}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hecke relation</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\sigma-q)(\\sigma+q^{-1}) = 0</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(P-1)(P+1) = 0</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Z}_2</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Antisym eigenvalue</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_- = -q^{-1}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_- = -1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Categorical coord</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\in \\mathrm{End}_R(\\mathbf{1})</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">i \\in \\mathrm{End}_{R[i]}(\\mathbf{1})</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Projective object</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{P}_q(V) = \\mathrm{Proj}(\\mathrm{Sym}_q V^\\vee)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{P}(V) = \\mathrm{Proj}(\\mathrm{Sym}\\, V^\\vee)</code> over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R[i]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Complex structure</td>\n<td>none (deformation absorbs it)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J = i \\cdot \\mathrm{id}_V \\in \\mathrm{End}_{R[i]}(V)</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J^2 = -1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>One-parameter subgroup</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{U}_q(1)</code> generated by <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{U}(1) \\subset \\mathrm{SU}(2)</code> generated by <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">i</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crossing weight</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q - q^{-1}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2i \\sin\\varTheta</code> for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q = e^{i\\varTheta}</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
